<title>USA: Cummins files $250 mln debt,equity shelf.</title>
<headline>Cummins files $250 mln debt,equity shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cummins Engine Co Inc filed Friday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $250 million in debt securities, preferred stock, common shares and warrants.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, which may including refinancing of debt, working capital needs and capital expenditures.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
